<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <% var title = "Privacy Policy | MK Damp & Timber LTD" %>
  <%- include('../partials/seo') %>
  <meta name="description" content="MK Damp & Timber LTD privacy policy covering data collection, cookies, user rights, and contact information." />
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar', { currentPage: 'privacy-policy' }) %>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <main class="page-content">
      <section class="hero-panel section">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Privacy first</span>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p>MK Damp &amp; Timber LTD is committed to protecting your personal data and handling information with care and transparency.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-light">
        <div class="content-columns">
          <article>
            <div class="toc-card">
              <h4>On this page</h4>
              <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
              <a href="#data-collected">Data collected</a>
              <a href="#use-of-data">Use of data</a>
              <a href="#cookies">Cookies</a>
              <a href="#your-rights">Your rights</a>
              <a href="#contact-details">Contact</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article>
            <section class="legal-section" id="overview">
              <h3>Overview</h3>
              <p>This privacy policy explains how MK Damp &amp; Timber LTD collects, uses and stores information from visitors to our website and customers of our services.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="legal-section" id="data-collected">
              <h3>Data collected</h3>
              <p>We collect information that you provide directly, such as name, contact details, property information and survey requirements.</p>
              <p>When you contact us by phone, email or via the website, we may retain details of your enquiry and any supporting images or documents.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="legal-section" id="use-of-data">
              <h3>How we use your data</h3>
              <p>We use personal information to respond to enquiries, provide quotes, arrange surveys, deliver services and manage our relationship with you.</p>
              <p>We do not sell your personal data to third parties. We may share information with trusted suppliers who support project delivery when necessary.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="legal-section" id="cookies">
              <h3>Cookies and tracking</h3>
              <p>Our website uses cookies to improve performance, remember your preferences and support key sections such as contact forms.</p>
              <p>You can manage cookies through your browser settings. We do not use cookies for advertising purposes on this site.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="legal-section" id="your-rights">
              <h3>Your rights</h3>
              <p>You have the right to access the data we hold about you, request corrections, object to processing and ask for data deletion where applicable.</p>
              <p>If you would like to exercise your rights, contact us using the details below and we will respond promptly.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="legal-section" id="contact-details">
              <h3>Contact information</h3>
              <p>MK Damp &amp; Timber LTD</p>
              <p>31 High Street, Winslow, Buckinghamshire, MK18 3HE</p>
              <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+441923904441">01923 904441</a></p>
              <p>Mobile: <a href="tel:+447808665460">07808 665460</a></p>
              <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@mkdampandtimber.co.uk">info@mkdampandtimber.co.uk</a></p>
            </section>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
